# Physics-based Projectile Simulator
a C-based physical 2- dimensional projectile simulator designed to calculate and analyse the motion of an object when thrown from the ground with a speed and a angle with the ground. The program takes input from user (i)the initial velocity of the projectile (ii)the angle it makes with the horizontal to determine the physical paramters of the flight path and other attributes realted to the motion such as maximum height attained, range of projectile and the total time taken for the projectile.
## Key calculations
* **Time of flight:**(T) Total time the projectile remains in the air.
* **Maximum Height attained:**(H) The peak altitude reached by the projectile during its motion.
* **Range:**(R) The total horizontal distance covered by the projectile during its time. 
