## Formulas used
* For (T): '$T = \frac{2v_o \sin(\theta)}{g}$'
* For (H): '$H = \frac{v_o^2 \sin^2(\theta)}{2g}$'
* For (R): '$R = \frac{v_o^2 \sin(2\theta)}{g}$'
